	(text "02 - MCU\nWaveshare ESP32-P4-Module: ESP32-P4NRW32 + ESP32-C6 WiFi6, 16MB flash, 32MB PSRAM, crystals and core DCDC on the module. 3.3 V in.\nNot a JLCPCB stock part: assembled without it, hand-soldered afterwards. The robot's only processor: motors and IMU over I2C, odometry over SPI, through the stack.\nPins by module EDGE: ToF/servos/LED left, odometry SPI + camera bottom, I2C/straps/UART right. One I2C bus, pull-ups here only.\nGPIO36 pull-up and GPIO34 pull-down are mandatory." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00003-0000-4000-8000-000000000166"))
